{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 164838, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 110918, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "温泉介绍", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1660376862, "updated_at": 1662798655, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1661132688, "last_at": 1691086910, "comment_count": 5, "status": 1, "summary": "前言拜托我们来玩的是天命之子你跟我说不喜欢看美少女洗澡金币少的新人还是只用一个池子吧能盯紧收泡沫可以多开嫌字多可以只看红字/绿字超链接可直接打开目录一、温泉是什么？二、为什么要泡温泉？三、怎么泡温泉？", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/video/1069/87565/2022/8/8/982276.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1252/h_747/1069/109198/2022/5/17/38769.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2340/h_1080/1069/87565/2022/7/13/177618.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 13, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 30402, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 13, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 164838, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">前言</span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(249, 182, 71); font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">拜托我们来玩的是天命之子你跟我说不喜欢看美少女洗澡</span></span><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(249, 182, 71);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">金币少的新人还是只用一个池子吧能盯紧收泡沫可以多开</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">嫌字多可以只看<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">红字</span>/<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">绿字</span>超链接可直接打开</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;目录</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">一、</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">温泉是什么？</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">二、为什么要泡温泉？</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">三、怎么泡温泉？</span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\">四、附加——温泉装饰</span></span></div></span><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:center;\">一、温泉是什么</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><span style=\"\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、在夜世界，魔界温泉进入。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、温泉共有5处，分别在温泉等级1/11/21/31开启，第五处开启资格被策划忘了。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、每处温泉可供5名天子（1队）进行沐浴，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">沐浴时间6个小时，消耗一个毛巾道具。</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">每1.5个小时</span>可以来偷窥一次，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">收获泡沫获得温泉硬币奖励</span>。<span style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:left;color:rgb(51,51,51);\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:left;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">天子温泉等级越高<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">回收数量越多</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:left;color:rgb(51,51,51);\">)</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">真是和天子签订契约后就能为所欲为</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">实际刷新机制为 倒计时4:30、3:00、1:30，三次刷新，所以可以在特定时间2连收获</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"video-play-wrapper\">\n                      <p class=\"video-title\"></p>\n                      <div class=\"img-video-div\"><img class=\"uploadVideoImg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/video/1069/87565/2022/8/8/982276.png\" data-url=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/video/1069/87565/2022/8/8/748582.mp4\" data-width=\"500\" data-height=\"1083\" style=\"display: inline;\" data-title=\"\" data-is_hot=\"0\" data-isb=\"1\">\n                     <i class=\"icon-video-play\"></i>\n                      </div>\n                    </div><br></div>\n                               </div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5、右侧四个子选项分别为：</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;①百鬼夜行：(偶尔会有，&lt;5星天子温泉皮肤&gt;保底条3倍增长活动)</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;主要作用是抓鬼魂小游戏，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">但现在主流是用5色灯笼直接扫荡</span>。</span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">可直接<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">获得天子温泉皮肤和温泉币</span>，5星很难出。</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;②温泉商店：可用温泉币购买毛巾（每次沐浴消耗一个），礼物，沐<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>浴剂、灯笼。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">新手只推荐购买毛巾。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>③温泉相册：可查看天子温泉皮肤获得情况以及灵气值（<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">重复获得天<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span>子温泉皮肤会获得灵气并可在沐浴时送出直接大量增长<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>经验</span>）第二项温泉装饰可查看装饰收集情况。</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第三项可查看温泉贴纸收集情况。</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; PS：标志有20的图标没有2D动画效果，天子2D会逐&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 渐开放。<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">我怀疑他们又给忘了</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;④温泉保管箱：可查看一切与温泉相关物品，主页物品栏也可以。区<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>别是可以在右下角查看配置中的装饰物品，并且可区<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>分各个温泉查看，从此我们还可以看出策划给第五个<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>温泉起名为硫磺温泉<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">但显然他已经忘记开放该温泉</span>。</span></span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"122\" data-height=\"132\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_122/h_132/1069/87565/2022/7/13/457228.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_122/h_132/1069/87565/2022/7/13/457228.png\" style=\"width: 111px; height: 120px;\"><img data-width=\"154\" data-height=\"157\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_154/h_157/1069/87565/2022/7/13/183261.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_154/h_157/1069/87565/2022/7/13/183261.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 117px; height: 120px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-align: center; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">二、</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-align: center; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">为什么要泡温泉</span></div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、天子的温泉等级（好感度属性）共有100级，<span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">00级时，HP总计提高初始面板的300%，攻防敏暴总计提高初始面板的200%。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、说明一下，Child刚到手时，就是在原生星级、等级1级、</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">好感</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">E级，加值+0，温泉1级，未穿装备的状态下，其面板属性为初始面板，这个面板数值可以在游戏中主页的图鉴里查到。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、5星天子温泉满级100级，4星80级，三星60级。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><br></span></span></div></span></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:0.37333rem;\"></span>此处引用“<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/user/index?uid=81618\" target=\"_blank\">lyzzzk</a>”的《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/154930.html\" target=\"_blank\">天子面板属性</a>》温泉部分详细数据请点击查看。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\">感谢各位前辈的硬核数据！</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>三、怎么泡温泉</span></div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp;</span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、首先我们应该选好除XP以外</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">究竟让谁来泡温泉</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">（一般为功能性最强天子）这里篇幅较大，我们直接移步“</span><div data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; display: inline !important;\"><span data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.21333rem;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><a data-v-67b6af28=\"\" href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/user/index?uid=109198\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"user-wrapper-title\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">苗条迎宝贝</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">”</span></a>的《<span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-size: 19.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/159032.html\" target=\"_blank\">优先泡温泉天子推荐</a></span></span>》。</span></span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; display: inline !important;\"><span data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.21333rem;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;额外讨论：关于温泉毕业角色不多的玩家，PVP+RB已经占用10个位置，留给WB刀的位置真不多了，在加上WB刀有的是联动现在不能获得，有的属性已经有4把刀或者可能出第四把，大概率会淘汰掉一名所以，可以斟酌考虑泡最新的两名。话说成长期新手也不用大量投入资源进WB，收益回报不如RB甚至地狱地铁。<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">我还得留几个位置给XP，XP必须全拉满不忘初心。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; display: inline !important;\"><span data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">我们</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">满级需要<span style=\"text-align: -webkit-right;\">1474001点温泉经验</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); text-align: -webkit-right;\">（1474001÷1700≈868次泡澡×6小时=</span><span style=\"text-align: -webkit-right; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">217天</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); text-align: -webkit-right;\">） 或 </span><span style=\"text-align: -webkit-right; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">37个5星天子温泉皮肤</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); text-align: -webkit-right;\">（重复相同天子获得温泉皮肤可以大量获得温泉经验）<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:right;\">“</span><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/user/index?uid=81618\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:rgba(0,182,79,0.7);font-size:16px;text-align:right;\">lyzzzk</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:right;\">”的《</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 182, 79, 0.7);\"></span><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/155184.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 182, 79, 0.7);\">温泉</span>经验表</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:right;\">》。</span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 13.9999px; text-align: -webkit-right; font-size: 13.9999px;\"></span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; display: inline !important;\"><span data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); text-align: -webkit-right;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:right;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; display: inline !important;\"><span data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"text-align: -webkit-right;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; text-align: right;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: right; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">3、那么我们应该怎么快速的获得经验和天子皮肤：</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; display: inline !important;\"><span data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"text-align: -webkit-right;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;①天子新出时<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">蓝PASS</span>任务（不管你是萌新大佬还是是新手都得随缘）这里参考<span style=\"text-align: left;\">“</span></span></span></span></div><a data-v-67b6af28=\"\" href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/user/index?uid=109198\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"user-wrapper-title\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">苗条迎宝贝</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\">”</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">的《<span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-size: 19.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/154876.html\" target=\"_blank\">抽对策性价比</a></span></span>》颠覆新手价值观（你以为你赚了）</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;②除了盯紧天子无限洗澡并偷窥获得温泉硬币</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">，我们还可以趁其洗澡时</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">送礼</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">（好怪在看一眼），送出礼物</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">要对应天子属性和类型的喜好</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">，送礼表格搬自<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">“</span></span><a data-v-67b6af28=\"\" href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/user/index?uid=109198\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"user-wrapper-title\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">苗条迎宝贝</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\">”</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">的《<span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-size: 19.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/158833.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">温泉泡法推荐</a><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">》</span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;③再者就是香精粉红色的“</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">花之精</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">”可增加20%的沐浴经验（1700×120%=2040）缺硬币老老实实买毛巾，按价格来说同样的价格还是毛巾获得经验更高。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">芳香精油增加金币不是温泉硬币</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><br></span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; display: inline !important;\"><span data-v-67b6af28=\"\" style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.21333rem;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"1252\" data-height=\"747\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1252/h_747/1069/109198/2022/5/17/38769.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1252/h_747/1069/109198/2022/5/17/38769.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1252/h_747/1069/109198/2022/5/17/38769.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">PS：四个温泉竟然获得经验没区别都是1700一次？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">四：<span style=\"text-align: center;\">温泉装饰</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-align: center;\"></span></div></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、在嫦娥的温泉商店里购买温泉装饰，一池温泉<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">最多放置20个饰品</span>。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、温泉装饰和天子可通过<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">长按进入编辑模式</span>，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">双击</span>天子或装饰可领其<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">调转方向，双指缩放大小</span>。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">长按空白区域</span>会出现一只蝴蝶，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">天子视线会跟随</span>，因此动作可能会触发R摇。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">仅限有动画天子</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">从来没有获得过温泉皮的天子泡澡会有雾气遮挡，获得后使用可以消除。</span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">恶</span>趣味温泉</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"2340\" data-height=\"1080\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2340/h_1080/1069/87565/2022/7/13/177618.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2340/h_1080/1069/87565/2022/7/13/177618.jpg\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"2340\" data-height=\"1080\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2340/h_1080/1069/87565/2022/7/13/292712.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2340/h_1080/1069/87565/2022/7/13/292712.jpg\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/video/1069/87565/2022/8/8/982276.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1252/h_747/1069/109198/2022/5/17/38769.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2340/h_1080/1069/87565/2022/7/13/177618.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/av